==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Special Clearance}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Two Can]]s spawn, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is a Red/Dark stage that dies to Dark Lazer spam. Berserkory is bulky, but it's nothing that your Lazer spam can't deal with. Make sure to bring Heavy Assault C.A.T. for the Dark Otters, as they're pretty bulky.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
''Given the nature of this Colosseum, you should prioritize using Special Cats.''
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Dark Lazer]]: In hindsight, making a Red/Dark stage in a gamemode where she has a two second cooldown was probably not a good idea.
*Talented [[Heavy Assault C.A.T.]]: Has extremely high damage against the Dark enemies, quickly shredding Two Can in particular.

